---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="section prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <blockquote class="quote">
      Wake up with determination. Go to sleep with satisfaction.
    </blockquote>

    <blockquote class="quote">
      "A man has two lives. The second one starts when he realizes he only
      has one."
    </blockquote>
    <p>
      I was born on August 16, 2002, and for most of my life I lived like
      that second life hadn't started yet — moving through decisions
      instead of making them. That line is the moment it flipped for me:
      not a countdown to something ending, but a wake-up call that this is
      the only version of my life I get, which means every choice in it
      actually counts.
    </p>
    <p>
      If there's one thing life has taught me, it's that being human comes
      with a job attached: to keep working on becoming your best self,
      deliberately, not by accident. I didn't start out doing that. Coming
      out of school, I let a lot of outside opinions decide what my career
      was supposed to look like, and I spent a while chasing directions
      that were never really mine to begin with.
    </p>
    <p>
      What I actually want is straightforward to say and a lot harder to
      do — to be someone of consequence. Not for recognition, but to prove
      to myself that I'm capable of more than I've shown so far, and to
      eventually build something that matters beyond me.
    </p>
    <p>
      That's what this whole stretch has been: navigation, not a straight
      line. I started in cybersecurity, I'm now working toward a computer
      science degree, and the goal past that is to build something
      genuinely important for humanity.
    </p>
    <blockquote class="quote">
      The compass was created before the clock, because direction is more
      important than time.
    </blockquote>

    <h2>Work</h2>
    <p>No formal experience in the IT field yet — that's what this next chapter is for.</p>

    <h2>Skills</h2>

    <h3>Cybersecurity</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Penetration testing</span>
      <span class="tag">Vulnerability assessment</span>
      <span class="tag">OWASP Top 10</span>
      <span class="tag">Threat modeling</span>
      <span class="tag">SIEM (Splunk, ELK)</span>
      <span class="tag">Incident response</span>
      <span class="tag">Identity & access management</span>
      <span class="tag">Zero Trust architecture</span>
      <span class="tag">Cloud security (AWS/Azure)</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Workflows & AI implementation</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">LLM agent design</span>
      <span class="tag">Prompt engineering</span>
      <span class="tag">RAG pipelines</span>
      <span class="tag">MCP tooling</span>
      <span class="tag">Process automation (n8n, Zapier)</span>
      <span class="tag">API integration</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Marketing</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">SEO</span>
      <span class="tag">Content strategy</span>
      <span class="tag">Growth marketing</span>
      <span class="tag">Brand positioning</span>
      <span class="tag">Marketing automation</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Communication & direction</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Public speaking</span>
      <span class="tag">Strategic communication</span>
      <span class="tag">Team leadership</span>
      <span class="tag">Mentoring</span>
      <span class="tag">Conflict resolution</span>
    </div>

    <h3>Computer science (Monash, incoming)</h3>
    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">Data structures & algorithms</span>
      <span class="tag">Software engineering practices</span>
      <span class="tag">Systems programming</span>
      <span class="tag">Databases</span>
      <span class="tag">Machine learning fundamentals</span>
      <span class="tag">Cloud computing</span>
    </div>

    <p class="meta skills-note">(edit me — this list is a placeholder starting point, swap in what's actually true)</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-section">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <a href="mailto:jaxon.doelling@outlook.com" class="contact-box">
        <span class="contact-label meta">Email</span>
        <span class="contact-value">jaxon.doelling@outlook.com</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/JaxonDoelling" class="contact-box">
        <span class="contact-label meta">GitHub</span>
        <span class="contact-value">@JaxonDoelling</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .quote {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .tags {
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .contact-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.05);
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s ease,
      box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .contact-box:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 24px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.25),
      0 0 4px rgba(47, 143, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .contact-label {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .contact-value {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
